serial-terminal (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show control characters (\n, \r, NUL, ...) as visible U+2400 symbols
    via a new "Show controls" toggle; receive area now prefers fonts that
    carry those glyphs (Cascadia Mono, Everson Mono).
  * Persist settings (last port, baud, data/parity/stop/flow, line ending,
    hex RX/TX, timestamps, auto-scroll, show-controls) in
    ~/.config/serial-terminal/config.cfg; restored on startup.
  * New custom application icon (DB9 serial connector).

 -- susmaz <susmaz@localhost>  Thu, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

serial-terminal (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: GTK3/Glade serial port terminal with port scanning,
    baud/parity/stop/flow settings, hex RX/TX, timestamps and auto-scroll.

 -- susmaz <susmaz@localhost>  Thu, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
